program	conformance/D11_spawn_closure_never_refused.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	a task body may not be `Never`: this closure's body never returns, so the task never completes and `join` on its handle could never return
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: a task body may not be `Never`: this closure's body never returns, so the task never completes and `join` on its handle could never return"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/D11_spawn_closure_never_refused.saw:14:26"
log	"     |"
log	" 14 |     let t = Thread.spawn {"
log	"     |                          ^"
log	"   hint: a task is something to wait for, and a `Never` body gives it a result that cannot exist. Write a forever-task as `-> Void` with a loop — `func serve() { while { ... } }` — and end it by cancelling the task or breaking the loop"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
